ty","name":"area/mtp-observability","color":"5319E7","default":false,"description":"MTP OpenTelemetry, telemetry, and logging extensions.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":8,"created_at":"2026-02-24T22:00:35Z","updated_at":"2026-08-27T09:54:52Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":{"id":534532,"node_id":"IT_kwDOAF3p4s4ACCgE","name":"Task","description":"A specific piece of work","color":"yellow","created_at":"2024-01-25T10:01:18Z","updated_at":"2024-07-26T10:11:34Z","is_enabled":true},"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"I was looking into an issue where Microsoft.Testing.Extensions.Telemetry on .net 9 was still fetching System.Diagnostics.DiagnosticSource 5.0.0 due to Microsoft.ApplicationInsights dependency. I noticed that Microsoft.ApplicationInsights has released major version 3 which no longer has System.Diagnostics.DiagnosticSource however it no longer supports netStandard2.0 as part of microsoft/ApplicationInsights-dotnet#3091. \n\nMicrosoft.Testing.Extensions.Telemetry and Microsoft.Testing.Extensions.VSTestBridge will need to choose a route:\n1. Drop netStandard2.0 in favor of .NETFramework 4.6.2 or higher\n2. See if ApplicationInsights restores NetStandard2.0 (dropped due to difficulty with OpenTelemetry microsoft/ApplicationInsights-dotnet#3130)\n3. Forever stay on Microsoft.ApplicationInsights 2.23.0\n4. Drop ApplicationInsights support","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/testfx/issues/7465/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/testfx/issues/7465/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_r